{"3635380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DEMONK", "steam_appid": 3635380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demonk is a cooperative horror experience for 1–4 players, where you take on the sacred role of Slavic monks — trained in the forgotten art of dealing with the dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: communicate with ancient spirits, uncover their stories, and choose whether to banish them... or negotiate for peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a world deeply rooted in Slavic mythology, every encounter is a test of faith, logic, and trust between players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success brings reward — money, relics, and reputation. But failure? That may cost your soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you find harmony with the beyond… or will the darkness consume you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THERE IS AN APPROACH TO EVERYONE, POSSIBLY THROUGH FOOD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635380/extras/b998b376f2cc36a642c6f8bddec35342.avif?t=1749138342\" width=620 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AND POSSIBLY THROUGH BONES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635380/extras/076f47df0216b5ad0eb593e4ac02b3eb.avif?t=1749138342\" width=620 height=270 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demonk is a cooperative horror experience for 1–4 players, where you take on the sacred role of Slavic monks — trained in the forgotten art of dealing with the dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: communicate with ancient spirits, uncover their stories, and choose whether to banish them... or negotiate for peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a world deeply rooted in Slavic mythology, every encounter is a test of faith, logic, and trust between players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success brings reward — money, relics, and reputation. But failure? That may cost your soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you find harmony with the beyond… or will the darkness consume you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THERE IS AN APPROACH TO EVERYONE, POSSIBLY THROUGH FOOD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635380/extras/b998b376f2cc36a642c6f8bddec35342.avif?t=1749138342\" width=620 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AND POSSIBLY THROUGH BONES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635380/extras/076f47df0216b5ad0eb593e4ac02b3eb.avif?t=1749138342\" width=620 height=270 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Demonk is a cooperative game for 1 to 4 players. You play as monks who must negotiate or banish evil spirits. Spirits and their banishment are based on ancient Slavic myths. For banishment or a pact with a spirit you will receive money.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Bulgarian, Danish, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish, Finnish, Czech, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635380/0d2dced5ede7a4ccea0d0e11a12180b88c1b81f3/header.jpg?t=1749138342", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635380/738d4ca9fa2ae9c6169af64932beec7c550a4880/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749138342", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635380/738d4ca9fa2ae9c6169af64932beec7c550a4880/capsul